	(text "NIBBLE CARD ALU3 - ALU BIT 3: one bit of the adder/subtractor, AND, OR, XOR"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 3.5 3.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "dacb6000-fb4f-477f-bb66-3bf21596574a")
	)
	(text "Cell: 2N7000 + 47k pull-up (NMOS, see docs/gate-cell.md).  73 transistors, 44 resistors, 3 LEDs, 100 x 100 mm (docs/cards.md).\nFrom the bus header: A3, B3 (register bits), SUB (1 = subtract), ONE (B replaced by 0001: INC, DEC), F1 F0 (function), EO (1 = drive the result onto the bus).\nTo the bus header: BUS3# (open-drain, active-low: pulled low when the result bit is 1 and EO = 1), CF (carry out; for SUB, 1 = no borrow; 0 for the logic functions), ZF (result is zero).\nLinks: carry C3 and zero-so-far ZS2 in from bit 2; the chains end here in CF and ZF.\nF1 F0 = 00: R = A + (B xor SUB) + SUB.   01: R = A and B.   10: R = A or B.   11: R = A xor B.  The four bit cards are this design with the bit baked in."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 45.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "09171339-b695-439e-a173-43b92313467c")
	)
	(text "B INPUT: BB = B, or 0001 when ONE=1 (INC, DEC).  Then the conditional invert: XB = BB when SUB=0, NOT BB when SUB=1 (two's complement: A - B = A + NOT B + 1, the +1 is SUB fed into the carry-in)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 165.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b6ecc2f5-708f-41f6-a9b3-99c86ed017b9")
	)
